        "text": "Plain sprite fetch."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_timing",
        "position": {
          "x": 768,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "`auto = fract(time / duration) × (1 + pause)`. Progress above 1 is clamped by the shine node, which is exactly the idle phase between sweeps. **Auto Animate** picks between this and the manual slider."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_shine",
        "position": {
          "x": 2432,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "The **Shine Sweep** node outputs the band mask and a tinted, intensity-scaled colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_comp",
        "position": {
          "x": 3178,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "`colour = sprite + band × sprite alpha` — the glint never leaks onto transparent pixels."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 3924,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Colour with glint, original alpha."
      }
